{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>The king is not saved</b> — The decrees are not like the design of the great counselor among men, who is the king. Now what benefit is there in his counsel, when he is not saved, despite the great power he has. The meaning is upon his armies."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:21.596651392Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}